  2MB Matrox"

I'm not 100% clear on which motherboard this is;  the indirect info is
thus:  
Manufacturer's Part # : SN-B3AAA-P2

- Alpha 21164 433MHz Processor 
- 64MB RAM 
- 2.1GB SCSI Hard Drive 
- 12X SCSI CD-ROM Drive 
