Did you check README.ncr53c8xx in drivers/scsi subdirectory of Linux
sources?  There is quite a number of useful hints there how to configure
your controller in case of troubles and this controller is quite
configurable.


: I had the same problem with the ncr53c875 controller but it
: works after doing "echo setsync 0 255 > /proc/scsi/ncr53c8xx/0"
