: >>>>> Which is what I said, you cannot overlap partitions.. tru64 uses the C
: partition for accessing entire disks. but linux will overwrite data on
: overlayed partitions. create a partition the entire size of the disk,
: overlaying exsisting partitions and then mkfs on it, see what happens to
