Worked for me with kernel 2.2.4 (I think - whatever the last kernel I
compiled on the Multia was...).  E-mail me and I could send you my
kernel configuration - might help.

For MP3 playing software, you can try mpg123.  This seems to work well
on the Multia.  For a GUI frontend (this is where you will have
trouble, as the TGA card and X server combination is pretty lousy with
respect to speed and overhead), you might try gqmpeg - a frontend to
mpg123.

