Dave Thiery wrote:
> 
> I just received my copy of it today and have just started going
> through all the online documentation.  But as of yet, I haven't come
> across anything that mentions using it along side Linux or WinNT.  How
> do you go about setting up a system like that?  And can it be
> installed on a system with AlphaBIOS??  Or would I have to change
